00:01:47,229 --> 00:01:56,036
This, combined with the fact that both of these are highly centered around automation, means that Factorio and software engineering end up sharing an insane amount of similarities.
这一点，加上这两者都高度围绕自动化的事实，意味着Factorio和软件工程之间有着惊人的相似之处。

